 - Lions of Zion, Madzimbabwe, Wu Lung, Ngoma and the Taftani.<br /> <br /> There are also a couple more Paradox spirits to really make your chronicle more insane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-22T05:05:19-08:00","id":790806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/787476-sell-me-on-mage-sorcerer-s-crusade?p=790791#post790791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hehe. Glad you liked it. May i recommend the Sorcerors Crusade Companion as well? It has an amazing look into the superstitions, faith, culture, clothes and food of the Renessaince. Outside that it offers a look at the World of Darkness at the time of the Sorcerors Crusade telling you all about Africa, Asia and the New World. Oh and it has a couple extra magical groups - Lions of Zion, Madzimbabwe, Wu Lung, Ngoma and the Taftani.<br /> <br /> There are also a couple more Paradox spirits to really make your chronicle more insane.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'll have to put that one off till after the holidays","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/